like, pepper and salt.

00:14:56.200 --> 00:14:57.120
What is the name of it?

00:14:57.560 --> 00:14:58.840
- Alu fry.
Alu fry?

00:15:03.480 --> 00:15:05.520
Looks like it’s called like Alu fry but

00:15:05.520 --> 00:15:07.560
Luke is calling it potato tornado.

00:15:07.560 --> 00:15:08.720
So we're going to try that out.

00:15:08.880 --> 00:15:09.680
- Alright.

00:15:09.680 --> 00:15:12.600
Really nice. My fan got me fried potatoes.

00:15:12.600 --> 00:15:14.280
That's pretty cool. What's your name?

00:15:14.280 --> 00:15:15.040
- Samiul Islam Chowdhury.

00:15:15.040 --> 00:15:16.120
Thank you for the potato fries.

00:15:16.240 --> 00:15:18.640
Okay, I'm gonna try this out now.

00:15:19.000 --> 00:15:20.080
See what it's like.

00:15:20.080 --> 00:15:21.360
Luke seems to love it.

00:15:27.480 --> 00:15:28.800
This is amazing.

00:15:31.280 --> 00:15:32.640
This is so good.

00:15:33.000 --> 00:15:34.880
- Nadir bro, how are you?
I am good.

00:15:34.880 --> 00:15:36.000
I keep running into people.

00:15:36.000 --> 00:15:37.320
- Nadir On The Go.

00:15:40.120 --> 00:15:41.080
Taking selfies.

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:43.120
This is harder to eat
than I thought it would be.

00:15:44.520 --> 00:15:48.080
So that was a very, very,
very hectic end to the day.

00:15:48.080 --> 00:15:48.800
That was a lot of fun.

00:15:48.800 --> 00:15:51.480
Now we got to get back to the hotel
and pack up because,

00:15:51.480 --> 00:15:53.960
